e-module-scss-module__nbagBW__learnContent"><header><h1>Introduction to Bac=
ktracking</h1></header><h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>Imagine you're stuck at an intersection point in a maze, and you know on=
e of the three routes ahead leads to the exit:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
