jiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>Next, you try option E, but it also leads to a dead end, so you backtrac=
k to the second junction point. After concluding that neither path D nor E =
works, you backtrack again to the first intersection point:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
