=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>Having determined that path A doesn't lead to the exit, you move on to p=
ath B and discover that it leads to the exit:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
